OL,3,AJaguar unveils new electric car after
OL,4,A'woke' ridicule
OL,5,
OL,6,FJaguar has revealed its new electric
OL,7,Fcar two years after its controversial
OL,8,Frebranding sparked a backlash with the
OL,9,Ffirm accused of going "woke".
OL,11,FThe unveiling of the all-electric Type
OL,12,F01 is a gamble for parent company JLR,
OL,13,Fwhich has invested billions reinventing
OL,14,FJaguar and is facing mixed reactions
OL,15,Fover the new car's design and the
OL,16,Fbrand's all-electric strategy.
OL,18,FThe car itself is an imposing four-door
OL,19,F"Grand Tourer", with a long bonnet that
OL,20,Fdeliberately harks back to Jaguar's
OL,21,Femblematic 1960s E-Type.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
